<title>PHILIPPINES: Primetown says 9-mth net up 86 pct.</title>
<headline>Primetown says 9-mth net up 86 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>	    (in millions of pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Revenues			  1,800 vs 789</p>
<p>    Net income			  403 vs 217</p>
<p>Note: Full name Primetown Property Group Inc. The company attributed its higher earnings to brisk sales of its condominium projects. -- Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
